  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bb7c856f8ab932b45898693b4b72f006, type: 3}
  rarity: 0
  itemType: 3
  description: '<b>THE ATOMIC RELAPSE VACCINATED CITIZENS TURN VIOLENT AS RAVENOUS
    HUNGER RETURNS</b>

    The miracle of the "Atomic Age" has rapidly devolved
    into a national emergency. Across the country, citizens who received the controversial
    uranium-based vaccine are experiencing a sudden, agonizing return of physical
    hunger and the withdrawal is driving them to violent extremes.

    Police departments
    in major metropolitan areas are overwhelmed by reports of ransacked grocery stores,
    hijacked delivery trucks, and aggressive brawls in supermarket aisles.

    The
    serum, championed by the Kennedy administration as a permanent cure for starvation,
    appears to be failing. Medical experts suspect the radioactive isotopes that
    previously sustained cellular energy are depleting much faster than anticipated,
    causing a severe metabolic crash. Having consumed no solid food for months, the
    sudden onset of starvation is plunging victims into a state of primal aggression.

    The
    FDA has issued an emergency broadcast urging the public to remain calm and to
    reintroduce soft foods slowly, warning that gorging after a prolonged atomic
    fast could cause lethal internal shock. Meanwhile, local governors are preparing
    to deploy the National Guard to protect food distribution centers from the growing,
    starving mobs.'
